424
00:20:07.390 --> 00:20:08.430
I don't know if I can.

425
00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:10.250
I know I can do 10 to 12.

426
00:20:10.670 --> 00:20:11.930
I bet I could do 10.

427
00:20:12.570 --> 00:20:13.830
I don't want to do it, though.

428
00:20:14.030 --> 00:20:14.610
I'm sipping.

429
00:20:14.610 --> 00:20:15.210
We're not moving.

430
00:20:15.210 --> 00:20:17.890
I'm sipping rosé, and like, I'm not moving.

431
00:20:18.050 --> 00:20:18.470
I was juSt.

432
00:20:18.710 --> 00:20:19.790
But here's the thing.

433
00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:21.050
I'm very competitive.

434
00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:25.510
So if you were like, we're going to do 10, I would just because I'm like stubborn and

435
00:20:25.510 --> 00:20:26.530
I'm like, I will do it.

436
00:20:26.670 --> 00:20:27.750
But I'm not doing it.

437
00:20:27.890 --> 00:20:29.190
Now you're gearing me up.

438
00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:30.130
No, we're not doing it.

439
00:20:30.130 --> 00:20:31.490
Because I'm also very competitive.

440
00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:32.150
I know.

441
00:20:32.430 --> 00:20:34.190
This is why we're great business partners.

442
00:20:35.070 --> 00:20:37.870
But we're going to agree right now to not do it.

443
00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:39.270
Here's what we're agreeing to.

444
00:20:39.450 --> 00:20:39.710
What?

445
00:20:39.910 --> 00:20:40.850
We can do 10.

446
00:20:41.450 --> 00:20:41.850
Right.

447
00:20:41.990 --> 00:20:42.590
On our knees.

448
00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:43.030
Mm-hmm.

449
00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:44.870
We believe that we can do 10.

450
00:20:45.650 --> 00:20:47.250
So we've basically done them.

451
00:20:47.710 --> 00:20:48.610
I love it.

452
00:20:49.950 --> 00:20:54.030
This episode begins with Oscar arriving to work at 7 a.m.

453
00:20:54.030 --> 00:20:54.790
like he always does.

454
00:20:54.930 --> 00:20:55.210
Sure.

455
00:20:55.570 --> 00:20:58.210
He always gets there super early while the door is still locked.

456
00:20:58.430 --> 00:20:58.570
Mm-hmm.

457
00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:03.850
He's trying to position himself so that he can see Matt from the warehouse.

458
00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:06.270
Well, coming super early works.

459
00:21:06.270 --> 00:21:08.210
He gets to see Matt, have a little chit-chat.

460
00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:13.030
And then he shares that, you know, besides this morning, they also had talked at Christmas.

461
00:21:13.030 --> 00:21:14.730
So, you know, a little bit of momentum.

462
00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:16.630
I have a continuity catch.

463
00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:17.230
I do.

464
00:21:17.430 --> 00:21:19.690
Me, Jenna Fisher, has a continuity catch.

465
00:21:19.770 --> 00:21:21.010
Oh, well, let's hear it.

466
00:21:21.190 --> 00:21:26.970
Matt and Oscar were both at the bar on St. Patrick's Day, which is between this morning

467
00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:27.590
