468
00:21:27.910 --> 00:21:28.730
What do you think of that?

469
00:21:28.730 --> 00:21:31.710
I think that is fantastic background catch.

470
00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:32.370
Thank you.

471
00:21:32.710 --> 00:21:33.230
You're welcome.

472
00:21:34.030 --> 00:21:37.650
Randy said that everyone actually came in extra early to shoot this.

473
00:21:37.890 --> 00:21:41.370
You know, we would usually start coming into work around 5.30 a.m.

474
00:21:41.490 --> 00:21:42.430
and we would be shooting

475
00:21:42.430 --> 00:21:43.030
