478
00:21:51.630 --> 00:21:52.730
Matt, you son of a gun.

479
00:21:53.290 --> 00:21:54.870
You could have sold it.

480
00:21:56.410 --> 00:22:00.830
Well, we were rolling by 6.12 a.m.

481
00:22:00.910 --> 00:22:02.550
Oh, my goodness.

