490
00:22:22.730 --> 00:22:27.470
And BJ shared on the commentary that he really loved how slowly the scene played out.

491
00:22:27.610 --> 00:22:30.810
Like, they really wanted all of those awkward silences.

492
00:22:31.130 --> 00:22:34.570
This is one of those character combinations we haven't really seen.

493
00:22:34.770 --> 00:22:35.930
And I love it.

494
00:22:36.090 --> 00:22:38.850
And they have moments throughout the episode that are so good.

495
00:22:39.150 --> 00:22:42.490
I have some questions about the stuff on Daryl's desk.

