00:22:48.710 --> 00:22:49.770
There's a mailbox.

503
00:22:50.050 --> 00:22:54.070
It's like a little fakie mailbox that might also be a bank.

504
00:22:55.070 --> 00:22:56.230
Like a piggy bank?

505
00:22:56.450 --> 00:22:56.870
Yeah.

506
00:22:57.050 --> 00:22:57.170
Yeah.

